    <string name="set_about">About Altivane</string>
    <string name="about_body">Altivane is an offline-first workout tracker built for cycling and hiking:\n· GPS track recording — keeps logging while locked, pause/resume\n· Live BLE heart rate / cadence with auto-reconnect\n· Barometric elevation and climb tracking (Keytel calories)\n· Vector compass + level, full-card data dashboard\n· MapLibre open maps: standard/satellite/hiking/cycling layers\n· Offline map packs by city — tracks visible without network\n· Waypoints: manual / per-km / per-100m-climb auto checkpoints, with photos\n· GPX 1.1 export (with HR extension and waypoints)\n· 8 home-screen widgets: speed/HR/distance/calories/compass/SOS\nAll data stays on the device: no account, no upload, no ads, no tracking.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer">Disclaimer: this app is in development and testing, for personal learning and outdoor reference only. Stay safe outdoors — track and sensor data are not for professional navigation or safety use.</string>

